# VCR Cassette Ownership

RULE: unified-api-contracts owns all VCR cassettes. Consumers reference by path — never duplicate.
WHY: Single source of truth for HTTP mocks; prevents cassette drift across repos.
CODEX: 02-data/vcr-cassette-ownership.md

DO:
 # In unified-api-contracts: record once with live API keys
 uv run python scripts/record_vcr_cassettes.py --venue binance

 # In consumers: use cassette_library_dir fixture or unified-api-contracts path (unified_api_contracts_external/<venue>/mocks/)
 import vcr
 cassette_dir = Path("../unified-api-contracts/unified_api_contracts/unified_api_contracts_external")  # or use conftest cassette_library_dir
 @vcr.use_cassette(str(cassette_dir / "binance/mocks/ticker_24hr.yaml"))
 def test_binance_ticker(): ...

NEVER:
 Copy cassettes to consumer repos
 Record cassettes outside unified-api-contracts
 Use VCR for WebSocket (different tooling required)
